sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User / Main
    participant C as TelloController
    participant S as UDP Socket
    participant D as Tello Drohne
 
    Note over U, D: Phase 1: Initialisierung
    U->>C: Instanziierung (Adresse, Port)
    activate C
    C->>C: __init__() (Socket erstellen)
    C->>S: send("command")
    S->>D: UTF-8 "command"
    deactivate C
 
    Note over U, D: Phase 2: LED Logik (Beispiel: send_pattern)
    U->>C: send_pattern(pattern)
    activate C
    alt Länge == 64
        C->>C: Formatierung: "EXT mled g ..."
        Note over C, S: Backend Kommunikation
        C->>S: send_command(cmd)
        activate S
        S->>S: UTF-8 Encoding
        critical UDP Transfer
            S->>D: Sende Paket
        option Erfolg
            S-->>U: Konsole: "Gesendet [cmd]"
        option Exception
            S-->>U: Konsole: "Fehler beim Senden"
        end
        deactivate S
    else Länge != 64
        C-->>U: Fehler: Ungültiges Pattern
    end
    deactivate C
 
    Note over U, D: Phase 3: Text & Clear
    U->>C: clear_matrix()
    activate C
    C->>C: Generiere 64x "0"
    C->>S: send_command("EXT mled g 000...")
    deactivate C
 
    U->>C: send_text("Hi")
    activate C
    C->>C: Formatierung: "EXT mled [dir] [col] ..."
    C->>S: send_command(...)
    deactivate C